  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangsamoro Normalization MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Trust Fund are to assist: (i) the Moro Islamic Liberation Front (MILF) former combatants and their communities to achieve their desired quality of life in a peaceful and inclusive manner; and (ii) in the development of the six previously acknowledged MILF camps with the end view of transforming these areas into peaceful and productive communities.</narrative>
  </description>
